<h2 style="color: #e74c3c;">Password Reset Request</h2>

<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your BlackPot account. If you did not make this request, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<div class="alert-box">
  <strong>Important Security Note</strong>
  <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0;">This link will expire in <strong>1 hour</strong>. For your security, do not share this link with anyone.</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{{resetLink}}}" class="button" style="display: inline-block;">Reset Your Password</a>
</p>

<p style="text-align: center; color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 13px;">Or copy this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="text-align: center; word-break: break-all; background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;">
  <code>{{{resetLink}}}</code>
</p>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Didn't Request a Password Reset?</h3>

<p>If you didn't request a password reset, no action is needed. Your password has not been changed. Your account is still secure with your current password.</p>

<p>If you believe someone is trying to access your account without permission, please <a href="mailto:support@blackpot.com">contact our support team</a> immediately.</p>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2c3e50;">Password Reset Tips</h3>

<ul style="margin-left: 20px;">
  <li>Create a strong password with at least 12 characters</li>
  <li>Use a mix of uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and symbols</li>
  <li>Avoid using personal information like your name or birthday</li>
  <li>Don't reuse passwords from other accounts</li>
</ul>

<p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px;">
  <strong>Need help?</strong> Visit our <a href="{{{helpCenter}}}">Help Center</a> or reply to this email for support.
</p>

<p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">
  Request ID: {{requestId}} | Time: {{requestTime}}
</p>